  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food &amp; Medicine for Orphans in Kenya with AIDS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Raising money to feed, clothe, educate, house, and provide medical assistance for orphans in Kenya. Each of the orphans is between one and eighteen years old and has AIDS. Our main challenge is to maintain the health of the children since they all have AIDS. Medicine is expensive. The solution is to increase awareness of our need and hope for donations. We are also applying for government grants. The long-term impact of all this is to save lives and help our children become productive citizens</narrative>
  </description>
